    "difficulty": "Intermediate",
    "estimated_minutes": 3,
    "bloom": "Remember",
    "content": "Important Intervention Programmes: Following the high incidence of poverty levels in the mid-1970s, three important food intervention programmes were introduced: 1. Public Distribution System (PDS) for food grains (already existing but strengthened); 2. Integrated Child Development Services (ICDS) in 1975; 3. Food-for-Work (FFW) in 1977-78.",
    "body": "Important Intervention Programmes: Following the high incidence of poverty levels in the mid-1970s, three important food intervention programmes were introduced: 1. Public Distribution System (PDS) for food grains (already existing but strengthened); 2. Integrated Child Development Services (ICDS) in 1975; 3. Food-for-Work (FFW) in 1977-78."
  },
