    "difficulty": "Beginner",
    "estimated_minutes": 3,
    "bloom": "Understand",
    "content": "Chapter Summary: Food security is essential to ensure that all people at all times have access to sufficient, safe, and nutritious food. In India, this is achieved through a combination of Buffer Stocks maintained by the FCI and the Public Distribution System (PDS) which provides subsidized food through Fair Price Shops.",
    "body": "Chapter Summary: Food security is essential to ensure that all people at all times have access to sufficient, safe, and nutritious food. In India, this is achieved through a combination of Buffer Stocks maintained by the FCI and the Public Distribution System (PDS) which provides subsidized food through Fair Price Shops."
